        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/pestszentimre",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Medieval architecture in Pestszentimre still reflects the styles of that era, giving the district a historic charm.",
